  "dossiers": [
    {
      "id": "dossier1947-five-thirty-one",
      "periodId": "p1947",
      "title": "五·卅一事件卷宗",
      "status": "adopted",
      "reviewNote": "本项目将现有史料纳入历史资料范围；页面保留原始摘录、来源关联和记录中的不确定性。该说明记录项目级采用范围，不代表逐条签名或独立发布日期。",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "dossier1947-association",
          "order": 1,
          "title": "历史背景",
          "eventIds": [
            "ev1947-association"
          ],
          "sourceIds": [
            "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
            "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
            "src-d6bde28106f8dfea4652"
          ],
          "placeIds": [
            "pl-guangzhou"
          ],
          "editorialStatus": "adopted-by-project-policy",
          "previousId": null,
          "nextId": "dossier1947-preparation",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "block-acb1f034a19eaf26459c",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "抗战胜利、内战爆发后，在中国共产党地下党组织的领导下，成立了中山大学爱国民主运动协会，以合法社团活动掩护地下革命工作，团结进步学生；",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
                "src-d6bde28106f8dfea4652"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dossier1947-preparation",
          "order": 2,
          "title": "组织与筹备",
          "eventIds": [
            "ev1947-preparation"
          ],
          "sourceIds": [
            "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
            "src-05a4dc929b96aef4f326"
          ],
          "placeIds": [
            "pl-guangzhou"
          ],
          "editorialStatus": "adopted-by-project-policy",
          "previousId": "dossier1947-association",
          "nextId": "dossier1947-march",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "block-cb50cb0a57f5f5e9c9d7",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "本文是亲历者回忆文章，作者周湘玫讲述自己在中山大学参与1947年“五卅一”运动的亲身经历：作者早年受进步思想影响，在中山大学爱国民主运动中接触地下党员；1947年全国掀起“反饥饿、反内战、反迫害”浪潮，中山大学成立相关工作委员会筹备游行，原定6月1日的游行提前至5月31日，以此规避国民党军警的破坏。",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-05a4dc929b96aef4f326"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dossier1947-march",
          "order": 3,
          "title": "游行",
          "eventIds": [
            "ev1947-march"
          ],
          "sourceIds": [
            "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
            "src-81318cee7c373bd858cd",
            "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
            "src-f14d9d5c612a1bc2fab1",
            "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a"
          ],
          "placeIds": [
            "pl-guangzhou",
            "pl-changdi"
          ],
          "editorialStatus": "adopted-by-project-policy",
          "previousId": "dossier1947-preparation",
          "nextId": "dossier1947-conflict",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "block-63802b3479425de94f0c",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "本文讲述1947年5月31日中山大学学生发起的“五卅一”爱国学生运动：为声援南京“五二〇”反饥饿、反内战、反迫害运动，两千多名中山大学师生在校内集合后前往市区游行，高举横幅，呼喊反内战、求温饱、争民主的口号；",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-81318cee7c373bd858cd",
                "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
                "src-f14d9d5c612a1bc2fab1",
                "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dossier1947-conflict",
          "order": 4,
          "title": "冲突",
          "eventIds": [
            "ev1947-conflict"
          ],
          "sourceIds": [
            "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
            "src-81318cee7c373bd858cd",
            "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
            "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a",
            "src-05a4dc929b96aef4f326"
          ],
          "placeIds": [
            "pl-guangzhou"
          ],
          "editorialStatus": "adopted-by-project-policy",
          "previousId": "dossier1947-march",
          "nextId": "dossier1947-rescue",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "block-86eb264fd3a42598ef40",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "游行途中两次遭到暴徒袭击，学生奋起抵抗，出于安全考量提前结束游行。当晚广州军警进入校园抓捕数十名参与师生，",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-81318cee7c373bd858cd",
                "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
                "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a",
                "src-05a4dc929b96aef4f326"
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "block-b7f159bdd7e3b6440688",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "游行前夕，特务破坏校车、抓捕学生，游行队伍与特务搏斗，20余名同学受伤；出发前作者写下遗书，做好为民主斗争牺牲的准备。",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-81318cee7c373bd858cd",
                "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
                "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a",
                "src-05a4dc929b96aef4f326"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dossier1947-rescue",
          "order": 5,
          "title": "营救",
          "eventIds": [
            "ev1947-rescue"
          ],
          "sourceIds": [
            "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
            "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
            "src-d6bde28106f8dfea4652",
            "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a"
          ],
          "placeIds": [
            "pl-guangzhou"
          ],
          "editorialStatus": "adopted-by-project-policy",
          "previousId": "dossier1947-conflict",
          "nextId": "dossier1947-memory",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "block-63a027c10fed286b1ced",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "师生坚持抗争，通过发布告社会书、开展营救活动迫使当局释放被捕人员，斗争持续至6月中旬落幕。",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
                "src-d6bde28106f8dfea4652",
                "src-1b96f4bcb5a26c81323a"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "dossier1947-memory",
          "order": 6,
          "title": "纪念与历史影响",
          "eventIds": [
            "ev1947-memory"
          ],
          "sourceIds": [
            "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
            "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
            "src-f14d9d5c612a1bc2fab1",
            "src-a0f9711619737bea3a0a",
            "src-d6bde28106f8dfea4652"
          ],
          "placeIds": [],
          "editorialStatus": "adopted-by-project-policy",
          "previousId": "dossier1947-rescue",
          "nextId": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "id": "block-1227b0e4825070ab0b06",
              "kind": "received-summary",
              "text": "运动结束后，中山大学爱国民主运动协会成员整理流血斗争史料编成《血债》秘密传播，同时校内一大批进步社团陆续建立，持续传播进步思想。文章最后回望历史，赞扬当年中山大学进步青年的爱国担当，总结这场运动的历史意义：它打击了国民党在广州的反动统治，使中山大学成为华南学生民主运动的重要阵地，也为革命与国家建设输送了人才。",
              "sourceIds": [
                "src-9ec7482b6edc778fba95",
                "src-c0ff1e454fdc7a30ce75",
                "src-f14d9d5c612a1bc2fab1",
                "src-a0f9711619737bea3a0a",
                "src-d6bde28106f8dfea4652"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
